  unitName: Omega Demise Shida
  unitId: 60096
  unitNumber: 1261
  description: A dark sorcerer from the Bariura Empire. Having transformed his body
    into a demonic state, he headed for a crater leading to another world, annihilating
    forces of the God Army along the way. However, he encountered the younger brother
    of the emperor of Bariura, and was unexpectedly thrown into the crater. He reached
    the other end of the passage, only to find that he was not in Ishgria. At first,
    he was dejected after having come so close, then failing to achieve his lifelong
    dream. But he found this new world to contain materials unknown even to the demons,
    and was soon eagerly absorbed in research. Many inhabitants of this strange world
    would become victims of his twisted experiments.
  summonDesc: Potential cannot be quantified. Even a failure can be part of a greater
    success, as I learned so long ago.
  fusionDesc: This holds potential.<br>Ah, the thrill of discovery!<br>I can find
    potential in you as well, if you're willing.
  evoDesc: No, my research is still imperfect! I can find no end to this recursive
    spiral of evolution...ahh, it so arouses the mind!
  element: 6
  rarity: 6
